cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work or are inspired by its idea, please credit Takeyuki-K and cite this repository. Project code is Apache-2.0; some data files are separately licensed (human-gait-derived references: CC BY 4.0; CMU motion-capture files) - see NOTICE and THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md."
title: "K1 MP Eco-Walk: passive MP toe joints, human-gait imitation and learned relaxation for energy-efficient humanoid walking (simulation)"
authors:
  - alias: "Takeyuki-K"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
date-released: "2026-10-06"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Takeyuki-K/k1-mp-ecowalk"
abstract: "Simulation study (MuJoCo) on the ROBOTIS AI Sapiens K1 humanoid model: passive spring toe (MP) joints, imitation of human gait data and learned joint relaxation for energy-efficient walking, extended to speed-command walking, turning, running and walk-run switching. Implementation generated with Claude (Anthropic) under the direction of Takeyuki-K."
keywords:
  - humanoid
  - reinforcement learning
  - energy efficiency
  - toe joint
  - variable impedance
  - motion imitation
  - MuJoCo
  - ROS 2
